          ERPs like SAP, Oracle, and ERPNext demand perfection and strict schema integrity, but the physical warehouse supply chain is messy. Traditional zonal OCR breaks when vendor layouts drift. ERPYAS bridges this chasm by completely decoupling cognitive AI extraction from deterministic transactional accounting.
        </p>

        <ol class="space-y-5">
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="mono text-sm text-ledger flex-shrink-0 pt-0.5">01</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-ink text-base mb-1">The Cost Bottleneck</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-inksoft leading-relaxed">
                SMEs waste hours on manual keying. We reduce document input latency from 48 hours to <strong class="text-ink">4.5 seconds</strong> with mathematical certainty.
